---
manual: styles.center
lines: [1115, 1121]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: E2
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 300, height: 300 do
  fill red
  @o = oval left: 100, top: 100, width: 50, height: 50, center: true
end
----------- test code
box = layout_of(oval)
assert_in_delta 75, box.x, 0.5, "center: true makes left the centre, so the box starts 25 pixels to the left"
assert_in_delta 75, box.y, 0.5, "and top the centre, so it starts 25 pixels higher"
r, g, b, = pixel_at(100, 100)
assert(r > 200 && g < 60 && b < 60, "(left, top) is painted: it is the middle of the oval")
refute pixel_at(135, 135)[1] < 100, "the corner an uncentred oval would cover stays empty"
